====Multi-word English semordnilaps ====

Any palindromic sentence or phrase that has a word boundary at its exact center can be split into a pair of semordnilaps; conversely any pair of semordnilaps make a palindrome when concatenated. For example, the semordnilap pair "bald elf" and "fled lab" combine to make the palindrome "bald elf fled lab".

